{"id":"atrave_s","lemma":"através","pos":"adv","rank":566,"glosses":["through, across (from one side to the other)","through, by means of"],"ipa":"/ɐ.tɾɐˈvɛʃ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/65/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-atrav%C3%A9s.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-atrav%C3%A9s.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"O sangue circula através do corpo.","en":"Blood circulates through the body.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"blood"},{"g":"to circle","l":"circular"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"body"}]},{"text":"Ele conseguiu escapar através de uma janela.","en":"He managed to escape through a window.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to get, obtain","l":"conseguir"},{"g":"to escape"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"window"}]},{"text":"Tom olhou através do binóculo.","en":"Tom looked through the binoculars.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/469742","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"gaze","l":"olhar"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"binoculars"}]},{"text":"Um raio de sol veio através das nuvens.","en":"A beam of sunlight came through the clouds.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"ray"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sun"},{"g":"to come","l":"vir"},null,null,{"g":"cloud","l":"nuvem"}]},{"text":"Tom se moveu através da multidão.","en":"Tom moved through the crowd.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"to move","l":"mover"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"crowd"}]}]}